{"pin":"AB03017","subcodes":[{"code":"AB03017","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou who art attracted by the Fragrances of God! Verily, I noted the contents of thy letter, which was beautifully composed, was informed of thy sorrow... O God, my God! This Thy handmaid is calling upon Thee, trusting in Thee","first_line_orig":"ایتها المنجذبه بنفحات الله قد اطلعت بمضمون تحریرک البدیع الانشاء و اطلعت  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"220","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"refs":[{"kind":"music","code":"E. Mahony","source":"E","locator":"Mahony","url":"https://music.elikamahony.com/track/blessings-for-husbands"},{"kind":"music","code":"K .Key","source":"K .Key","url":"https://youtu.be/ntAUavBUd44"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#090 p.118x","source":"MMK1","locator":"090 p.118x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/381516697"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#234 p.305x","source":"MMK1","locator":"234 p.305x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/321610745"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MNMK#069 p.145","source":"MNMK","locator":"069 p.145","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMAB/mmab-143.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.065-066x","source":"BPRY","locator":"065-066x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/464523010"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BSC.434 #786x","source":"BSC","locator":"434 #786x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/compilations/bahai.scriptures/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BWF.394-395x","source":"BWF","locator":"394-395x","url":"https://archive.org/details/bahaiworldfaithselectedwritingsofbahaullahandabdulbaha./mode/2up"},{"kind":"translation","code":"CUPAB.010-011x","source":"CUPAB","locator":"010-011x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/abdul-baha_compilation_utterances_station"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SWAB#090x","source":"SWAB